{"id":"vod_hh_130291","vodId":"130291","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"∀高达","name_cn":"∀高达","date":"1999-01-01","year":"1999","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第50集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/25002822298bfb27721a692c0cd21afc.jpg"},"summary":"主角罗那（兰/拿）是一个平凡的月之子（月之居民）。为贯彻月之女王迪安娜的回归地球行动而与另外两个同伴一同被送到地球。因不适应新环境而几乎遇险，被姬艾尔/苏菲亚姐妹所救而为她们家打工。在一次偶然的机会下发现了埋在矿山中的Turn A Gundam并凭借月之子的经验/判断力而驾驶其对抗入侵的月之回归军。动画并没有特意便标榜罗那为New Type。剧中一些细节，例如罗那变装美女“罗伦”，用高达运牛，洗衣服等等都为这部高达增添了一份前所未有的轻松感．","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-04-07 12:42:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elY53xla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aADPVNBe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b2kv0xvd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aQW0yk7d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYQ3Z1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b826J1oe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elY53x6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erkR386a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dG65lRyb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erkR38wa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eZ6VL8ve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyPr3wVb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ejRq3YWe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b68REW7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aKrZp8re/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/en5r3g4d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e0RVx07b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aOYy